<title>7 · The two sieves — Sixty Years Later</title>
<meta name="description" content="Lem designed a machine to grow scientific theories the way an egg grows an organism, and blamed the coming information crisis on formal symbol-pushing. His own endnote has the better answer: a farm needs a second sieve, wired not to the phenomenon but to the addressee. 2026 built the first and failed the second.">
